### AgriLink MS3 local demo
# Start the backend with the dev-mock profile first. Run requests from top to bottom.
# IntelliJ HTTP Client saves generated IDs from the create responses below.
@base = http://localhost:8083
@customer = 12

### 1. Development product catalog
GET {{base}}/api/dev/products

### 2. Create an order (50.000 + 15.000 = 65.000 TND)
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

{"lignes":[{"produitId":101,"quantite":10},{"produitId":102,"quantite":5}]}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### 3. Retrieve the created order
GET {{base}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

### 4. Customer history
GET {{base}}/api/orders/customer/{{customer}}
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

### 5. Confirm the order
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

### 6. Verify stock reduction: 101 = 90, 102 = 145
GET {{base}}/api/dev/products

### 7. Cancel the confirmed order
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

### 8. Verify stock restoration: 101 = 100, 102 = 150
GET {{base}}/api/dev/products

### 9. Create a separate order for delivery progression
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

{"lignes":[{"produitId":103,"quantite":2}]}

> {% client.global.set("deliveryOrderId", response.body.id); %}

### 9a. Confirm the delivery order before simulating MS4
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/{{deliveryOrderId}}/confirm
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

### 10. Simulate preparation
PATCH {{base}}/api/dev/orders/{{deliveryOrderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"statut":"IN_PREPARATION"}

### 11. Simulate shipment
PATCH {{base}}/api/dev/orders/{{deliveryOrderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"statut":"SHIPPED"}

### 12. Simulate delivery
PATCH {{base}}/api/dev/orders/{{deliveryOrderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"statut":"DELIVERED"}

### 13. Empty order: 400
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

{"lignes":[]}

### 14. Invalid quantity: 400
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

{"lignes":[{"produitId":101,"quantite":0}]}

### 15. Unknown product: 404
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

{"lignes":[{"produitId":999999,"quantite":1}]}

### 16. Another customer cannot retrieve the first order: 404
GET {{base}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
X-Customer-Id: 13

### 17. Invalid backward delivery transition: 409
PATCH {{base}}/api/dev/orders/{{deliveryOrderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"statut":"IN_PREPARATION"}

### 18. Confirmation after cancellation: 409
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}
